        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 55D2010, Modern Wall Mounted Towel or Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis versatile Modern Double Robe Hook is not only great for holding robes, but it will also hold towels and even purses in a bathroom stall. The Wall Mounted Robe Hook is available in an array of contemporary finish colors. It is easy to install and comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2010-specifications.gif?v=1704354685\" width=\"600\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 55D2010 Double Robe Hook Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 55D Modern Series\"><b>Deltana 55D Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Modern Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Hook Span: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Hook Span: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2010-speicications.pdf?v=1691095331\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 55D2010 Double Robe Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
